# Misty icon manifest
# Lists every octicon SVG file used by the application.
# Format: <name>-<size>.svg  (one per line, no paths)
# Only simple filenames are copied at build time — paths and special characters are rejected.
# Run a grep for icon name strings in src/application/ to audit usage.

